---
---

<div id="container">
	<section class="hero">
		<p class="eyebrow">
			<span class="status-dot"></span>
			Software Engineer · Ireland
		</p>
		<h1 class="hero-title">Full-Stack Developer</h1>
		<p class="hero-lead">
			Hi there! I'm Rían<sup id="footnote-ref-1">1</sup>, a Software Developer from Ireland.
		</p>
		<div class="hero-body">
			<p>
				I'm currently working at Solidroad as a Software Engineer. I'm interested in
				building scalable, maintainable and modern full-stack applications.
			</p>
			<p>
				My background is in Computational Linguistics — the intersection of computer science
				and human language. Over the years I've interned at Microsoft on Azure Communication
				Services (part of Microsoft Teams), and worked as a Software Engineer in Research at
				Trinity College Dublin on Irish speech technology as part of the ABAIR project.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="hero-actions">
			<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/cv.pdf">Download CV</a>
			<a class="btn" href="https://github.com/ParadauxIO" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
			<a class="btn" href="/#contact">Get in touch</a>
		</div>

		<footer class="footnotes">
			<p id="footnote-1"><sup>1</sup> Pronounced "Ree-yin" or "Ree-an".</p>
		</footer>
	</section>
</div>

<style lang="scss">
	#container {
		padding: 4rem 2rem 2rem;
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.hero {
		max-width: 44rem;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--accent-hover);
	}

	.status-dot {
		width: 0.5rem;
		height: 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--accent);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, transparent);
	}

	.hero-title {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		line-height: 1.05;
		color: var(--heading);
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.hero-title {
			font-size: 3.5rem;
		}
	}

	.hero-lead {
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.hero-body p {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, var(--border));
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;

		&:hover {
			background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, transparent);
			color: var(--accent-hover);
		}
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background: var(--accent);
		border-color: var(--accent);
		color: #fff;

		&:hover {
			background: var(--accent-hover);
			border-color: var(--accent-hover);
			color: #fff;
		}
	}

	sup {
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		vertical-align: super;
		cursor: help;
	}

	.footnotes {
		margin-top: 3rem;
		padding-top: 1rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.footnotes p {
		margin: 0;
	}
</style>
